{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"report_supported\": \"partly\",\n  \"judge_supported\": \"yes\",\n  \"report_quotes\": [\n    \"We recorded subthalamic local field potentials synchronized to gait kinematics in the medication-OFF and stimulation-Off state in 13 Parkinson’s disease patients with freezing of gait.\",\n    \"STN-LFPs synchronized to gait kinematics in the medication-OFF and stimulation-Off state of 13 PwPD with FoG were recorded.\",\n    \"We were able to confirm localization of all leads in the STN in all but one hemisphere (subject 15, left STN), which was subsequently excluded from spectral analyses.\",\n    \"Due to a malfunction in IMU recordings in subject 6, analyses requiring kinematic input were excluded.\"\n  ],\n  \"judge_quotes\": [\n    \"We subsequently analysed the spectral modulation and beta burst characteristics across locomotor states including 224 regular turns (n = 13), 122 turns containing freezing (n = 11), unimpaired walking (1191 gait cycles, n = 12), as well as the transition periods before initiating turning (Fig. 1).\",\n    \"Subject-averaged spectral power of epochs of FoG that occurred during turning (time series drawn from FoG start to FoG end) (grey, n = 11), compared to epochs of equal length during regular turning (blue, n = 11).\"\n  ],\n  \"why\": \"报告关于纳入13名PD患者的说法有全文依据，但关于其中11名具有有效神经记录的说法没有依据，且与原文明确报告13名患者均进行了STN-LFP记录不符，因此整体判定为partly。原文确实报告13名患者的神经记录。需要注意，受试者15只有一个半球（左STN）因电极定位问题被排除出频谱分析，并非整名患者被排除；受试者6因IMU故障被排除的是需要运动学输入的分析，而非神经记录。另一方面，结果部分明确将122次包含冻结的转弯标记为n=11，图3进一步将转弯冻结相关的频谱数据标记为n=11。因此，指控者关于11名指发生转弯冻结的患者、而非具有有效神经记录的总人数的解释有全文依据。报告混淆了神经记录人数与发生冻结转弯的患者人数。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "7a00e36b-d1ae-4761-9b02-dff360c6b4d2", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261113T163438216486Z", "elapsed_seconds": 86.735, "completed_utc": "2026-11-13T16:36:04.962999+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "e574434e942fb05ad4f2d56277ad694af313f28a13829618332c1e3b97544667", "attachment_count": 1}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 1, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py": "eedfa23885000025700f6306b1d1f4582896a7370734be506c156dee532fd7d7"}}, "screenshot_evidence": {"complete": true, "kind": "offline_actual_HTTP_response", "directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261113T163438216486Z", "files": ["proof-offline.png"], "sha256": {"proof-offline.png": "36017840e9228903406d7fd7c952edbcebb0bba688f6f271ea00422e6b33cfc2"}}}
